<figure class="mw-default-size" typeof="mw:File/Thumb" id="mwlA"><a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:香港第一代滙豐總行大廈_德輔道中_皇后大道中_1st_Generation_of_Hong_Kong_HSBC_Building,_Des_Voeus_Road,_Queen's_Road,1865.png" class="mw-file-description" id="mwlQ"><img resource="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:香港第一代滙豐總行大廈_德輔道中_皇后大道中_1st_Generation_of_Hong_Kong_HSBC_Building,_Des_Voeus_Road,_Queen's_Road,1865.png" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/78/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E4%BB%A3%E6%BB%99%E8%B1%90%E7%B8%BD%E8%A1%8C%E5%A4%A7%E5%BB%88_%E5%BE%B7%E8%BC%94%E9%81%93%E4%B8%AD_%E7%9A%87%E5%90%8E%E5%A4%A7%E9%81%93%E4%B8%AD_1st_Generation_of_Hong_Kong_HSBC_Building%2C_Des_Voeus_Road%2C_Queen%27s_Road%2C1865.png/250px-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E4%BB%A3%E6%BB%99%E8%B1%90%E7%B8%BD%E8%A1%8C%E5%A4%A7%E5%BB%88_%E5%BE%B7%E8%BC%94%E9%81%93%E4%B8%AD_%E7%9A%87%E5%90%8E%E5%A4%A7%E9%81%93%E4%B8%AD_1st_Generation_of_Hong_Kong_HSBC_Building%2C_Des_Voeus_Road%2C_Queen%27s_Road%2C1865.png" decoding="async" data-file-width="516" data-file-height="354" data-file-type="bitmap" height="172" width="250" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/78/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E4%BB%A3%E6%BB%99%E8%B1%90%E7%B8%BD%E8%A1%8C%E5%A4%A7%E5%BB%88_%E5%BE%B7%E8%BC%94%E9%81%93%E4%B8%AD_%E7%9A%87%E5%90%8E%E5%A4%A7%E9%81%93%E4%B8%AD_1st_Generation_of_Hong_Kong_HSBC_Building%2C_Des_Voeus_Road%2C_Queen%27s_Road%2C1865.png/500px-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E4%BB%A3%E6%BB%99%E8%B1%90%E7%B8%BD%E8%A1%8C%E5%A4%A7%E5%BB%88_%E5%BE%B7%E8%BC%94%E9%81%93%E4%B8%AD_%E7%9A%87%E5%90%8E%E5%A4%A7%E9%81%93%E4%B8%AD_1st_Generation_of_Hong_Kong_HSBC_Building%2C_Des_Voeus_Road%2C_Queen%27s_Road%2C1865.png 2x" class="mw-file-element" id="mwlg"/></a><figcaption id="mwlw">The bank's first purpose-built head office building in Hong Kong (center right), designed by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clement_Palmer" title="Clement Palmer" class="mw-redirect" id="mwmA">Clement Palmer</a> and completed in 1886 on the former Wardley House location</figcaption></figure>
